tuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/grigori-karpin" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4558017&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607264907" alt="Grigori Karpin" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4558017)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/grigori-karpin" >Grigori Karpin</a></span>.</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/t-aint-no-sin">T'Ain't No Sin</a> - &quot;<em>Uwuu, you stiww have skin?! Teehee! No wowwies, Imma hewp you get wid of it</em>&quot; Written by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/daveyoufool" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2034230&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607264907" alt="daveyoufool" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2034230)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/daveyoufool" >daveyoufool</a></span>.</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/chef-s-table">Chef's Table</a> - &quot;<em>When I'm cooking for myself, my diet goes to shit.</em>&quot; Written by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dysadron" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4384469&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607264907" alt="Dysadron" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4384469)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dysadron" >Dysadron</a></span>.</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/patience">Patience</a> - &quot;<em>None of them had a ghostly Klavigar that could be anywhere or anyone she wanted to be, working tirelessly to lay the foundation.</em>&quot; Written by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/malycegraves" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4916887&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607264907" alt="MalyceGraves" style="background-image:url(h