				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item # :&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5127&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Object Class:&lt;/strong&gt; Safe&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Special Containment Procedures&lt;/strong&gt;: SCP-5127 is to be contained in a dry and cool place. SCP-5127 is only allowed to be accessed by personnel with level 3 security clearance or higher.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5127 is a 120 ml Povidone-iodine wound solution, when applied to a wound, it effectively cures the subjects wound within 4 hours, exact time depending on the severity of the wound. all attempts to replicate the active ingredients of SCP-5127 have been unsuccessful.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Request 5127-1:&lt;/strong&gt; Agent ██████████ has requested to apply one (1) drop of SCP-5127 to apply to his scar wound. Request denied.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Request 5127-2:&lt;/strong&gt; Dr. ██████████ ████████ has requested to apply two (2) drops of SCP-5127 for testing D-5127-2 with a wound on his legs with approximately five (5) inch in height and two (2) inch wide. Request has been approved.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Request 5127-3:&lt;/strong&gt; Dr. ██████ ██████ has requested 35 drops to transfer in her container for her own wounds. Request denied.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Request 5127-4:&lt;/strong&gt; Dr.████████ ██████ has requested 13 drops for testing on SCP-682&#039;s wounds. Request has been approved.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/montom27&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7083563&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607264909&quot; alt=&quot;montom27&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7083563)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/montom27&quot;  &gt;montom27&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
