l attempts to prevent SCP-5295-1 from returning to SCP-5295 have been unsuccessful.</p> <p><strong>Addendum:</strong> Recovery Log</p> <p>SCP-5295 was recovered in Utah where multiple people were being found massacred with a storybook found close to them. A recovery team retrieved SCP-5295 and brought it back to the facility for testing.</p> <p>Breach Log</p> <p>SCP-5295-1 breached containment after when it was required to kill 10 humans. The entity was able to kill all 10 humans in 6 minutes and 32 seconds. It then returned to SCP-5295 and merged with it.</p> <div class="footer-wikiwalk-nav"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p>&#171; <a class="newpage" href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-xxxw">SCP-XXXW</a> | SCP-XXXX | <a class="newpage" href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-xxxy">SCP-XXXY</a> &#187;</p> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-j-mckeown" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7065144&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607264909" alt="Dr J McKeown" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7065144)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-j-mckeown" >Dr J McKeown</a></span></p> 
