&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span&gt;Requested Documentation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;FROM: General William Pendergast (Deputy Director of Foundation Contingency Planning Operations)&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;tt&gt;TO: All Staff working on Project Heimdall&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;tt&gt;RE: Requested Documentation&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;The O5 Council has requested further documentation related to Project Heimdall (CPO 83910301). All staff should feel free to pursue any of these or other topics of research at their leisure.&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
