						 <div style="display: none"></div> <div class="creditRate"> <div class="rateBox"> <div class="rate-box-with-credit-button"> <div class="creditButton"> <p><a class="fa fa-info" href="#u-credit-view"></a></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div style="clear:both;"></div> <div id="u-credit-view"> <div class="fader"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-jp-sandbox3.wdfiles.com/local--code/credit%3Abackmodule/1" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="" width="" class="" style=""></iframe></p> </div> <div class="modalcontainer"> <div class="modalbox"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h2><span>Info</span></h2> </div> <hr /> <div class="credit first"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--code/info%3Astyle/3" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="" width="" class="close-credits" style="height:2em;margin: 0;padding: 0;border: 0;background: transparent;"></iframe></p> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><strong>AIAD Homescreen</strong><br /> Hub and Canon authored originally by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lurkd" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1500566&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607264911" alt="LurkD" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1500566)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lurkd" >LurkD</a></span>.<br /> 2020 Homescreen Revamp by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/placeholder-mcd" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6536693&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607264911" alt="Placeholder McD" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6536693)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/placeholder-mcd" >Placeholder McD</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/estrellayoshte" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3781861&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607264911" alt="EstrellaYoshte" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3781861)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/estrellayoshte" >EstrellaYoshte</a></span>.<br /> Special thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sunnyclockwork" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1621343&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607264911" alt="SunnyClockwork" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1621343)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sunnyclockwork" >SunnyClockwork</a></span> for the original AIAD logo, as well as their development of Maxwellism within the Canon.</p> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/lurk-d-s-personnel-file" target="_blank">More by LurkD</a><br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/desk-of-junior-designer-s-yvonne" target="_blank">EstrellaYoshte's Artpage</a></p> </div> </div> <hr /> <div class="credit-back" style="text-align: center;"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--code/info%3Astyle/2" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="height:2em;width: 100%;margin: 0;padding: 0;border: 0;background: transparent;"></iframe></p> </div> <div class="creditBottomRate" style="position:relative;height:30px;"> <div style="text-align: center; top: 0px;"></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/aiad-homescreen/itlogo3.png" style="position: absolute; margin-top: -5.5%; margin-left: -7px;" width="164px" alt="itlogo3.png" class="image" /> <div class="logobox"> <p><tt>SCP FOUNDATION | IT Dept.</tt><br /> <tt>AIAD &lt;Artificial Intelligence Applications Division&gt;</tt></p> </div> </div> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <div style="width: 60%; margin: auto; text-align: center;"> <div class="audio_iframe aiadance"><iframe src="http://www.scpwiki.com/aiad-homescre