ot.com/user:info/lurkd" >LurkD</a></span></strong></p> <ul> <li><strong><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/alert-lockdown-initiated">ALERT! LOCKDOWN INITIATED!</a></strong></li> <li><strong><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/command-query-separation">Command-Query Separation</a></strong></li> <li><strong><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/superencipherment">Superencipherment</a></strong></li> <li><strong><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/clock-multiplier">Clock Multiplier</a></strong></li> <li><strong><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/null-terminating-string">Null-terminating String</a></strong></li> </ul> <hr /> <h5><span><span style="text-decoration: underline;">After Action Reports:</span></span></h5> <p><strong>Hello World by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lurkd" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1500566&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607264911" alt="LurkD" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1500566)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lurkd" >LurkD</a></span></strong></p> <ul> <li><strong><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/hello-world" target="_blank">Hello World: Part I</a></strong></li> <li><strong><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/hello-world-part-ii" target="_blank">Hello World: Part II</a></strong></li> <li><strong><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/hello-world-part-iii" target="_blank">Hello World: Part III</a></strong></li> <li><strong><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/hello-world-part-iv" target="_blank">Hello World: Part IV</a></strong></li> </ul> <div style="font-weight: bold"> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Limited&nbsp;Memory&nbsp;by&nbsp;Team&nbsp;.AIC</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Limited&nbsp;Memory&nb