&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item Description:&lt;/strong&gt; A pair of black Bluetooth █████ brand headphones that when worn prevent the wearer from hearing anything other than the audio coming from them, if any is playing. Headphones do not appear to run out of battery, and any connected devices will display them as having 100% battery.&lt;br /&gt;
