&lt;strong&gt;Influence At 🕒:&lt;/strong&gt; In an Intersite Arm - Iowa, America.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item Description:&lt;/strong&gt; A 1m x 1m mass of Lunar Rock from the Moons Southern pole. Non-anomalous except for the location of recovery.&lt;br /&gt;
