&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:110%;&quot;&gt;│ HomeBase ← CenCom ← Lancer II ↔ Lancer Crew │&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;[SIGNAL CONNECTED]&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;[LMNR]&lt;/strong&gt; Time&#039;s up, you buffoons. Who&#039;s buying the beer?
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;[LMNR]&lt;/strong&gt; Hello, guys? Uhh, let&#039;s see-&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
