&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;[SIGNAL SWITCHED]&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:110%;&quot;&gt;│&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;#32;&amp;#32;&amp;#32;&amp;#32;&amp;#32;&amp;#32;&amp;#32;&lt;/span&gt;HomeBase ← CenCom ← Lancer II&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;#32;&amp;#32;&amp;#32;&amp;#32;&amp;#32;&amp;#32;&amp;#32;&lt;/span&gt;│&lt;br /&gt;
│ Lancer Crew ↔ Meta Probe Four ↔ Lancer II │&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;[SIGNAL CONNECTED]&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;[LMNR]&lt;/strong&gt; There, switched to general broadcast on Probe Four. How was the trip?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;[LMNR]&lt;/strong&gt; Paul? Ed? This is Alan, I&#039;m not receiving you guys. I&#039;ve got the docking seal ready to-&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;lt; A loud thump, followed by mechanical locking is heard. &amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;[LMNR]&lt;/strong&gt; Jesus Christ! Give me some warning at least! Didn&#039;t think you guys would be so eager to get back, anyways. Seal&#039;s engaged. How&#039;d it go?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;[CTNI]&lt;/strong&gt; Everything perfect.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;[YATZ]&lt;/strong&gt; Everything perfect.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;[SIGNAL CUT]&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
