&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-caption&quot; style=&quot;width:300px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Biomedical readings of the Lancer crew, sent immediately prior to re-entry.&lt;br /&gt;
The three leftmost lines represent the brain function of the crew, and the three rightmost the crew&#039;s heart rate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
