&lt;strong&gt;Note:&lt;/strong&gt; Cookie dispensed contained numerous essential oils.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Player:&lt;/strong&gt; Doctor Margin&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Statement:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Everything you hate.&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;
