&lt;strong&gt;Note:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;em&gt;I wouldn’t have expected any less, to be honest.&lt;/em&gt; - Junior Researcher Tawnes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Player:&lt;/strong&gt; Junior Researcher Mistopheles&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Statement:&lt;/strong&gt; “Weird Al&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;
