&lt;strong&gt;Note:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;em&gt;Jesus fucking Christ. If you like a famous person, do NOT put their name in this. I can&#039;t listen to Weird Al the same way ever again.&lt;/em&gt; - Junior Researcher Mistopheles&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Player:&lt;/strong&gt; Dr. A. Maliss.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Statement:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Acausality&amp;quot;.&lt;br /&gt;
