&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Player:&lt;/strong&gt; Dr. Clef&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Statement:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Something I would do.&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Result:&lt;/strong&gt; [REDACTED]&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Note:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;em&gt;You know what? I&#039;m going to get Konny to use this thing.&lt;/em&gt; - Dr. Clef. Note from O5 Council: by unanimous decision, Doctor Kondraki is banned from use of SCP-1459.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Player:&lt;/strong&gt; Doctor Margin&lt;br /&gt;
